PN,13401
SC,0001
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,F28th December marked the 50th
OL,7,Fanniversary of what is arguably the
OL,8,Fmost iconic version of BBC One's mirror
OL,9,Fglobe.
OL,11,FBut 28th December 1974 is also thought
OL,12,Fto be the date BBC Two got a refresh
OL,13,Ftoo.
OL,15,FThe revolving cube '2' ident was
OL,16,Freplaced by the cylindrical lined '2'
OL,17,Fwhich remained in use until 1979.
OL,19,FThe word "colour" did not feature on
OL,20,Fthe new ident ` just as it was
OL,21,Fwithdrawn from use on BBC One.
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis reflected a conscious decision by
OL,7,FBBC TV ` or at least Presentation ` to
OL,8,Fstop actively promoting the fact an
OL,9,Findividual programme was in colour.
OL,11,FBy then, all new network programmes and
OL,12,Froutine repeats of programmes less than
OL,13,Ftwo years old were in colour.
OL,15,FOther than the Open University and
OL,16,Folder schools programmes, there was
OL,17,Flittle in black and white by then apart
OL,18,Ffrom material which only the densest of
OL,19,Fviewers wouldn't realise was years old.
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13403
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would be no shock to viewers much
OL,7,Fover the age of 6 or 7 ` even those
OL,8,Fwatching with a brand new colour set `
OL,9,Fto discover that an old film, Champion
OL,10,FThe Wonder Horse or Sergeant Bilko was
OL,11,Fin glorious monochrome.
OL,13,FShortly after the change to the idents,
OL,14,FRadio Times stopped highlighting colour
OL,15,Fprogrammes too. Instead a weekly
OL,16,Ffootnote to the listings reminded
OL,17,Freaders that "all BBC TV programmes are
OL,18,Fin colour...unless otherwise
OL,19,Findicated."
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13404
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FOf course, the 'BBC Colour' tag stayed
OL,7,Fon end credits for another three years.
OL,8,FThe reason for this isn't so
OL,9,Fimmediately obvious.
OL,11,FIntriguingly with the Presentation
OL,12,Frefresh, the BBC Two clock got a
OL,13,Fradical new look.
OL,15,FLittle is known about the new BBC Two
OL,16,Fclock although there is a
OL,17,Freconstruction of it online.
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13405
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat we do know is that it was very
OL,7,Fquickly abandoned. The old clock
OL,8,Freturned. (Pedantic note ` we don't
OL,9,Fknow for sure when the line between the
OL,10,Fident and the clock was removed. Was
OL,11,Fthis before December 1974? Or when the
OL,12,Fold clock returned?)
OL,14,FA Kaleidoscope junction from early 1975
OL,15,Fshows the clock branded 'BBC2 COLOUR' `
OL,16,Fminus the line ` in use during
OL,17,Fafternoon adult education programmes
OL,18,Fbut the use of this version may have
OL,19,Fbeen an operational error. It is
OL,20,Fpresumed that two versions of the clock
OL,21,F` one without the suffix ` were always
OL,22,Favailable to the announcer.
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13406
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FQuite why the new clock failed is a
OL,7,Fmystery.
OL,9,FIf someone disliked it intensely ` or
OL,10,Fif it proved impractical operationally
OL,11,F` why did this not get picked up
OL,12,Fbeforehand?
OL,14,FAnother thing worth mentioning is that
OL,15,Fthe corporate BBC Two logo remained a
OL,16,Fkey part of the channel's look with its
OL,17,Fprominent role on the clock.
OL,19,FWhy did it stay on the BBC Two clock
OL,20,Fwhen its BBC One counterpart was
OL,21,Fremoved from the globe, clock and
OL,22,Fschools diamond?
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13407
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe changes on BBC Two were less
OL,7,Fsignificant than the much-loved
OL,8,Fmodification to the globe.
OL,10,FAt this point in time, there were still
OL,11,Fviewers who could not receive BBC Two
OL,12,Fand others who rarely watched what to
OL,13,Fthem ` if not to those of us brought up
OL,14,Fon BBC TV ` was the third channel
OL,15,Frather than the second.
OL,17,FIt would take another 16 years ` with
OL,18,Ftwo more revamps along the way ` for
OL,19,FBBC Two to finally gain a powerful
OL,20,Fvisual identity.
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13408
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1783632451
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCOut with the revolving cube
OL,4,Cand in with the cylinder
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut this ident is still part of the
OL,7,Fchannel's story.
OL,23,APub: 29-Dec-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,135,120,200,300,0,100@
